<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13412" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπηδ-άω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>leap off,</i> esp. of riders, <i>dismount,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fab.</u>
				16
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Jul.
				<u>Or.</u>
				2.60a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>start off from, turn away from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπό τινος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Art.</u>
					47
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἀπὸ τῆς φύσιος</span>
			<i>from</i> its natural position, of a joint, ib.<i><span class="en">
				61
			</span></i>; metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπὸ τοῦ λόγου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Tht.</u>
					164c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Σωκράτους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					1.2.16
				</span></i>
			: abs., <i>leap off,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				613b
			</span></i>; <i>stalk off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἴχεται ἀποπηδήσας πρὸς ἄλλον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					720c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὰ Περσῶν ἤθη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Procop.
					<u>Goth.</u>
					1.24
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>rebound,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				803b1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.610
			</span></i>.</div>
